  "qid": "191",
  "tip": "<p>When Firestore performance is acceptable but costs are high, look first at <i>indexes</i>. Keep only the <i>composite</i> and <i>single field</i> indexes your queries need and consider disabling <i>single field indexing</i> on unused or large fields to cut write and storage costs.</p>",
